criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
Very good written and spoken German language proficiency (questionnaires and verbal instructions);
legally valid written informed consent to participate in the study;

for patients in the schizophrenia group: diagnosis within the F20.X category according to ICD-10.
Exclusion criteria:
no ongoing substance use; for healthy participants: clinical and anamnestic exclusion of comorbid neurological and relevant psychiatric disorders;
